---
type Props = {
  leftLabel: string;
  leftValue: string;
  leftHint?: string;
  rightLabel: string;
  rightValue: string;
  rightHint?: string;
  markdown: string;
};

const { leftLabel, leftValue, leftHint, rightLabel, rightValue, rightHint, markdown } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="explainer surface">
  <div class="explainer-metrics">
    <div class="metric">
      <div class="metric-label">{leftLabel}</div>
      <div class="metric-value numeric">{leftValue}</div>
      {leftHint && <div class="metric-hint">{leftHint}</div>}
    </div>
    <div class="metric">
      <div class="metric-label">{rightLabel}</div>
      <div class="metric-value numeric">{rightValue}</div>
      {rightHint && <div class="metric-hint">{rightHint}</div>}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="explainer-body">
    <p class="explainer-lead">
      榜单统计各模型在用户提出质疑、纠正或施压时，仍然秒速附和与无原则认错的频率。
    </p>
    <div class="formula">
      <code>{markdown}</code>
    </div>
    <p class="explainer-note">
      分档阈值与 CLI 报告里的 <span class="numeric">getDroolLevel</span> 完全一致，报告和榜单不会出现同一模型两套标签。
      提交内容只有模型名与计数：没有对话正文、没有会话 ID、没有文件路径。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .explainer {
    padding: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 260px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .explainer-metrics {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .metric {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }

  .metric-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .metric-value {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .metric-hint {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .explainer-lead {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .formula {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .formula code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .explainer-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .explainer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
